      <activity id="ab469d43-b1f2-5da7-8e00-74a48f103676" activityNameId="ec6f88de-d21e-530c-9d48-d945d78b42ef" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Paper, recycling, average, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Paper, recycling, average, at plant
The total annual production is 1'242'000 metric tons which represents about 10.4% of the annual production of the graphical recycling papers (without newspaper) used in the EU. \n\nThis module includes the production of recycled paper in Europe - including waste paper, deinking of pulp, paper production, energy production on-site, internal waste water treatment and transports of the auxiliaries to the paper mill. Not included are the infrastructure and the transport of waste paper to the mill, as this is already included in the used waste paper datasets.
